WEBVTT

00:00:02.442 --> 00:00:03.600
kenst zogn,

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:10.890
vi azoy hostu gevust az s'iz, milkhome kumt? vi ho- vos hot geshen frier, az di,

00:00:11.082 --> 00:00:12.156
tsu visn?

00:00:12.128 --> 00:00:14.282
 ikh'l aykh zogn ot vos:

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:18.780
vos es geyt on,

00:00:19.114 --> 00:00:22.270
a groyser krig darf vern,

00:00:22.641 --> 00:00:27.210
hobn mir gezen nokh in land,

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:29.115
hobn mir ir gefilt.

00:00:29.273 --> 00:00:32.591
mir hobn gefilt deroyf, beys ikh hob zikh gelernt

00:00:33.019 --> 00:00:37.480
in militer-shCHOOL, hobn,

00:00:38.554 --> 00:00:42.600
hobn undzere, kentik, rusn,

00:00:42.925 --> 00:00:48.040
ongefaln ⟨oy- i-⟩ oyf F- di finen, Finlandye,

00:00:48.156 --> 00:00:50.730
oyf Finlandye, di finen.

00:00:51.328 --> 00:00:52.790
ot di finen

00:00:53.337 --> 00:00:55.508
hobn geholfn di doytshn.

00:00:56.357 --> 00:01:01.560
di doytshn flegn derlangen ahin, gever,

00:01:02.618 --> 00:01:06.155
un zey hobn zeyer shtark geshlogn

00:01:06.617 --> 00:01:08.163
undzer militer.

00:01:09.773 --> 00:01:12.973
nor in Rusland iz geven a sakh militer,

00:01:13.907 --> 00:01:16.196
iz azoy

00:01:16.607 --> 00:01:19.318
hobn zey farkhapt di erd

00:01:19.476 --> 00:01:24.250
velkhe zey, Stalin hot gevolt. azoy farshtey ikh.

00:01:24.825 --> 00:01:30.850
undz hot men gezogt az es hot ongefaln oyf Rus- oyf Ru- oyf rusish, oyf Rusland

00:01:30.850 --> 00:01:33.577
hobn ongefaln di finen, Finlandye.

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:36.024
nor dernokh dem,

00:01:37.060 --> 00:01:38.640
bay hayntikn tog,

00:01:38.899 --> 00:01:40.563
vi es vayzt

00:01:40.857 --> 00:01:43.537
di papirn, dokumentn,

00:01:43.537 --> 00:01:45.862
dervayzn az Rusland

00:01:46.898 --> 00:01:49.592
hot ongefaln oyf Finlandye.

00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:53.101
Finlandye hot geholfn di doytshn.

00:01:54.745 --> 00:01:57.945
di doytshn hobn in der tsayt

00:01:58.677 --> 00:02:01.790
ongehoybn farkhapn Eyrope.

00:02:02.423 --> 00:02:08.613
di doytshn iz hobn gekrokhn alts neenter

00:02:08.613 --> 00:02:11.479
tsu der grenets fun Rusland.

00:02:13.392 --> 00:02:16.626
mir hobn azoy, mentshn flegn iberloyfn.

00:02:16.969 --> 00:02:19.933
s'iz geven, az, Stalin

00:02:20.445 --> 00:02:22.464
hot farfirt mit Hitlern

00:02:23.263 --> 00:02:28.240
a pakt fun helfn eyne di andere,

00:02:29.473 --> 00:02:34.640
hobn mir farshtanen, mir hobn shoyn dan farshtanen, az

00:02:34.640 --> 00:02:36.774
zeyer nit rikhtik.

00:02:37.033 --> 00:02:39.491
er tut dos azoy vi

00:02:39.818 --> 00:02:43.950
er halt unter dem fashizm, dem Natsizm.

00:02:43.952 --> 00:02:47.000
tsu undz flegt dergeyn vos er tut, Hitler,

00:02:47.833 --> 00:02:53.650
un oyb Hitler hot geven dan gefirt milkhome kegn England,

00:02:54.010 --> 00:02:56.046
⟨iz⟩ hot gefirt milkhome,

00:02:56.136 --> 00:02:59.094
 farkh- gekent farkhapn,

00:02:59.094 --> 00:03:04.072
 Tshekhoslovak-... vegn AVSTRIYA reyd ikh shoyn nit. in AVSTRIYA iz oykh di zelbe NEMTSes...

00:03:04.072 --> 00:03:09.629
Tshekhoslovakye, farkhapn a halb Poyln, tseteyln zikh mit Stalinen.

00:03:10.024 --> 00:03:12.120
Stalin hot genumen un...

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:14.557
ot iz, tsum bayshpil, geven di grenets.

00:03:14.918 --> 00:03:18.050
ot do iz geven undzer,

00:03:18.968 --> 00:03:22.556
undzer UKREPRAYON; do iz geven farfestikt shtark

00:03:23.102 --> 00:03:24.803
oyf der gantser leng.

00:03:24.803 --> 00:03:29.289
iz er fun da- danen opgegangen un iz avekgegangen in Poyln.

00:03:29.312 --> 00:03:32.175
er iz, dos hot er oykhet nit getort ton.

00:03:32.552 --> 00:03:37.637
mentshn flegn, ibergebn... zey flegn geyn, OSOBENNO yidn,

00:03:37.637 --> 00:03:42.110
yidn flegn iberloyfn oyf undzer zayt fun Rusland,

00:03:42.171 --> 00:03:43.813
flegn zey geyn

00:03:43.813 --> 00:03:48.746
in Babruysk, in, afile in andere shtet.

00:03:49.242 --> 00:03:54.214
zey flegn dokh loyfn. flegn zey dertseyln vos s'tut der doytsh.

00:03:55.063 --> 00:03:58.317
un vos vayter es iz gegangen

00:03:58.317 --> 00:04:00.795
di tsayt tsu fertsik eyntn yor,

00:04:01.138 --> 00:04:03.747
alts mer hot zikh gefilt

00:04:04.058 --> 00:04:07.562
az Hi- az, di NEMTSes

00:04:07.703 --> 00:04:09.733
tuen azelkhe zakhn

00:04:09.733 --> 00:04:11.729
vos zey klaybn zikh,

00:04:11.820 --> 00:04:14.413
 onfaln oyf Rusland.

00:04:14.706 --> 00:04:15.830
ir farshteyt?

00:04:16.107 --> 00:04:19.940
 tsum bayshpil,

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:29.426
 m- es iz ge- far, far dem letstn, di letste nakht far nakht,

00:04:29.426 --> 00:04:32.480
vos iber dray sho arum hot zikh ongehoybn di milkhome,

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:35.929
ib⟨er, ib-⟩ iber etlekhe sho arum hot zikh ongehoybn di milkhome,

00:04:36.458 --> 00:04:40.430
iz gekumen tsu forn tsu undz in polk,

00:04:40.430 --> 00:04:43.623
gekumen tsu forn a BRIGADNer komisar,

00:04:44.794 --> 00:04:48.990
a BRIGADNer komisar TANKOVYKH VOYSK, fun TANKOV⟨YE⟩...

00:04:50.295 --> 00:04:53.340
nu, zey vey- zey veln dos imetser visn,

00:04:53.340 --> 00:04:54.542
v⟨e⟩t dos hern...

00:04:55.071 --> 00:04:58.136
un er hot gehaltn far undz a rede.

00:04:58.648 --> 00:04:59.958
er hot gezogt,

00:05:00.201 --> 00:05:03.907
"es geyt bay der bafelkerung groyse klangen

00:05:04.656 --> 00:05:09.788
vos Hitler vil mit zayn armey

00:05:10.225 --> 00:05:12.919
onfaln oyf Sovyetn-Rusland.

00:05:13.785 --> 00:05:15.013
hert dos nit!

00:05:15.013 --> 00:05:16.951
dos zaynen provokatores.

00:05:17.700 --> 00:05:22.216
dos, provokatores firn azelkhe li⟨nk⟩s."

00:05:23.522 --> 00:05:24.495
ir farshteyt?

00:05:26.425 --> 00:05:27.881
es iz geven,

00:05:27.881 --> 00:05:30.266
di gantse shtot hot geredt,

00:05:30.728 --> 00:05:33.264
avu du geyst nit un du herst nit,

00:05:33.264 --> 00:05:37.471
az Hitler klaybt zikh oyf undz onfaln. es iz dergangen

00:05:37.478 --> 00:05:41.060
fun dortn UNK ikh gleyb nit az Stalin hot nit gevust.

00:05:41.060 --> 00:05:43.259
er hot alts gevust.

00:05:43.755 --> 00:05:46.347
un es ken an andersh mol trefn,

00:05:46.573 --> 00:05:50.887
vayle der iz geven zeyer a groyser merder, Hitler,

00:05:51.568 --> 00:05:54.380
un es iz geven a merder Stalin oykh,

00:05:55.011 --> 00:06:00.590
ken zayn az Stalin hot gemeynt az Hitler efsher... efsher; ikh ken zikh nit nemen far deroyf,

00:06:00.917 --> 00:06:03.543
nor mir zeen itster vos s'iz geven...

00:06:03.820 --> 00:06:09.399
az er hot gekent mit im makhn ⟨z-⟩ tsunoyffirn a brudershaft, sholem.

00:06:10.705 --> 00:06:13.427
hot er gekent dos di zelbe zakh ton,

00:06:13.427 --> 00:06:19.339
vi hot geton a mol der keyser in der ershter melt- velt-milkhome, N- NIKOLAY...

00:06:19.564 --> 00:06:24.586
er iz geven fakt-, tsum bayshpil, er iz geven nit keyn rus; er iz geven a NEMETS.

00:06:24.762 --> 00:06:26.764
zayn vayb iz geven a NEMKe.

00:06:27.546 --> 00:06:31.235
un dan hot geven di revolutsye hot gedarft

00:06:31.663 --> 00:06:36.314
onge- ongegangen, ongegangen di revolutsye tsvishn

00:06:36.338 --> 00:06:39.499
dem oylem, tsvishn, der bafelkerung,

00:06:39.499 --> 00:06:41.124
tsvishn di arbeter.

00:06:41.468 --> 00:06:43.909
in Daytshland oykhet azoy iz gevezn,

00:06:44.708 --> 00:06:47.228
⟨az⟩ zey hobn gevart oyf revolutsyes,

00:06:47.228 --> 00:06:49.033
hobn zey gevolt,

00:06:49.033 --> 00:06:52.441
zoln zikh di f- bafelkerung

00:06:52.521 --> 00:06:54.472
tsvishn zikh tsunoyfklapn.

00:06:56.723 --> 00:07:00.294
ikh, keyn mol volt ikh, keyn mol gleyb ikh nit

00:07:01.127 --> 00:07:05.782
az zi iz a kroyve, di,

00:07:05.782 --> 00:07:12.950
di, dem, dem,... vi ruft er zikh? geven der WIL'GEL'M, tsi vi hot er geheysn?

00:07:13.007 --> 00:07:18.142
iz di vayb NIKOLAY's geven a kroyve dem keys- dem,

00:07:18.142 --> 00:07:20.882
NEMETSKn's, keyser.

00:07:21.360 --> 00:07:26.170
un d- un, der keyser aleyn in rusn,

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:29.302
in Rusland, iz er oykh geven a NEMETS, a doytsh.

00:07:30.169 --> 00:07:32.174
fu- zaynen gegangen nokh

00:07:32.174 --> 00:07:38.215
fun a mol on, zaynen zey geven ale doytshn, onheybndik fun PЁTR PERVYY,

00:07:38.215 --> 00:07:41.587
hot er genumen a vayb EKATERINA, iz zi geven a NEMKe.

00:07:41.712 --> 00:07:44.096
dernokh dem, di NEMKe hot genumen

00:07:44.096 --> 00:07:46.649
a NEMETS hot zi genumen far a man,

00:07:46.842 --> 00:07:50.008
un azoy iz dos gegangen di gantsene tsayt.

00:07:50.402 --> 00:07:55.138
un dernokh dem hobn zey gemakht az di bafelkerung zol zikh tseshlogn tsvishn zikh,

00:07:55.164 --> 00:07:58.235
vos hot geshen mit UNK?

00:07:56.443 --> 00:07:58.794
iz gevorn di revolutsye.

00:07:58.794 --> 00:08:02.394
iz rekhn ikh oykh az Stalin mit Hitlern,

00:08:02.535 --> 00:08:04.532
khotsh Stalin iz geven a GRUZIN

00:08:04.532 --> 00:08:08.166
un Hitler iz geven a, an AVSTRIETS, a NEMETS,

00:08:08.425 --> 00:08:14.076
iz dan, efsher ken zayn az zey hobn zikh tsvishn zikh tsunoyfgeredt

00:08:14.076 --> 00:08:17.649
az me zol zikh tseklapn eyne on di andere,

00:08:17.740 --> 00:08:23.023
nor Hitler hot nit azoy gemeynt; Hitler hot gevolt farkhapn alts,

00:08:23.410 --> 00:08:27.555
hot Stalin zikh opgenart in deroyf. dos iz mayn meynung.

00:08:27.662 --> 00:08:29.070
er hot zikh opgenart,

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:32.634
vorem es ken in der velt nit zayn az er zol

00:08:32.640 --> 00:08:36.617
nit visn vos... er hot ⟨geb-⟩ gebrakht tsu firn

00:08:36.617 --> 00:08:40.464
kimat vi dray hundert divizyes tsu dem grenets

00:08:41.212 --> 00:08:44.517
fun Rusland... er zol nit visn fun deroyf.

00:08:44.672 --> 00:08:48.159
az fun ale zaytn hot men geredt vegn deroyf.

00:08:48.958 --> 00:08:53.035
es iz geven shpyonen vos hobn ibergegebn oykhet

00:08:53.194 --> 00:08:54.757
di gantsene tsayt,

00:08:54.882 --> 00:08:57.384
hot dos kentik Stalin gevust.

00:08:57.384 --> 00:08:59.831
ikh farshtey nit, far vos hot er tsugenumen,

00:08:59.831 --> 00:09:04.528
 di armey fun, dem ayngefestiktn ort,

00:09:04.602 --> 00:09:08.260
nokh Minsk, in Belarusye un azoy vayter ⟨oyf⟩ der grenets,

00:09:08.260 --> 00:09:12.139
un hot opgeshlept ahin o in, Poyln,

00:09:12.145 --> 00:09:15.179
un di ⟨o⟩ farfestikte ort,

00:09:15.179 --> 00:09:17.724
avu s'iz geven ayngefestikt,

00:09:17.832 --> 00:09:20.745
hot er dos tserisn, tsebrokhn,

00:09:21.983 --> 00:09:26.702
azoy vi er hot dos gevolt az er zol onfaln. azoy kumt dos oys VRODE.

00:09:27.332 --> 00:09:29.654
andersh farshtey ikh nit, ikh.

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:31.697
un vos hot geshen mit dir un dayn...?

00:09:31.264 --> 00:09:33.319
 mit mir?, nu,

00:09:33.319 --> 00:09:37.316
oyf morgn, dray a zeyger UNK gekumen, hot zikh ongehoybn di milkhome.

00:09:37.677 --> 00:09:41.700
hot zikh ongehoybn di milkhome, hobn mir glaykh ongehoybn... bay undz iz

00:09:41.700 --> 00:09:43.526
nit geven afile,

00:09:43.650 --> 00:09:49.044
di pushkes undzere zaynen geven, m⟨'iz,⟩ do iz geven eyn pushke un eyn traktor.

00:09:49.371 --> 00:09:51.190
a traktor, dos iz aza

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:53.482
mashin, velkhe shlept,...

00:09:52.543 --> 00:09:55.895
vu hostu geven y- do, yetst? vu hostu geven?

00:09:55.834 --> 00:10:01.042
ikh bin geven dortn o in lager, in lager, VOENNOM lager.

00:10:01.082 --> 00:10:02.985
nit vayt iz geven

00:10:02.985 --> 00:10:06.256
a aerodrom. aerodrom iz

00:10:06.769 --> 00:10:12.464
aza ort avu es zetsn zikh avek di flier, di aeroplanen,

00:10:12.777 --> 00:10:16.399
di V- di militer-aeroplanen undzere.

00:10:16.523 --> 00:10:19.564
farshteyt? iz glaykh in dem tog

00:10:19.881 --> 00:10:22.203
hobn mir derhert, es rayst zikh,

00:10:22.783 --> 00:10:25.578
es rayst zikh bombes un es flien,

00:10:25.888 --> 00:10:29.358
, aeroplanen doytshishe.

00:10:29.382 --> 00:10:31.823
doytshishe aeroplanen flien

00:10:32.993 --> 00:10:36.700
oyfn aerodrom. zey tsebrekhn ale,

00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:41.036
zey raysn oyfet ale f- ale aeroplanen di rusishe.

00:10:41.582 --> 00:10:44.343
un di aeroplanen velkhe heybn zikh oyfet,

00:10:44.704 --> 00:10:48.422
iz flegn onflien MESSER- MESSERSCHMITTn azoy vi flign,

00:10:48.422 --> 00:10:51.684
UNK ⟨un me⟩ fleg glaykh, ⟨d-⟩

00:10:51.775 --> 00:10:55.937
 aropklapn di, di SAMOLЁ- di ale flier hot men tseklapt

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:58.907
fun dem aerodrom, dos vos mir hobn gezen.

00:10:59.318 --> 00:11:02.248
zey hobn di shtot aroyfgevorfn oyf ir bombes.

00:11:02.288 --> 00:11:05.572
oyf Paritsh in de⟨m⟩ ershter nakht hobn zey arayngevorfn

00:11:05.798 --> 00:11:07.327
dray bombes:

00:11:07.958 --> 00:11:10.266
ongeflien a SAMOLЁT, dray bombes,

00:11:10.266 --> 00:11:13.419
glaykh gebrent a shtub un geharget a por yidn.

00:11:13.442 --> 00:11:16.129
dos iz geven in der ershter nakht.

00:11:16.277 --> 00:11:18.323
hot zikh ongehoybn di milkhome.

00:11:18.323 --> 00:11:20.675
do hobn mir ongehoybn optretn.

00:11:21.373 --> 00:11:24.084
mir hobn ongehoybn optretn pamelekh.

00:11:25.221 --> 00:11:27.628
mir zaynen ibergegangen di taykh.

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:32.049
mir hobn gemeynt az m'vet undz heysn az mir zoln do aynfestikn zikh.

00:11:33.085 --> 00:11:34.631
dernokh dem zaynen mir,

00:11:34.857 --> 00:11:36.791
hot men geheysn vayter forn,

00:11:37.185 --> 00:11:39.524
zaynen mir derforn bi⟨z Zh⟩lobin.

00:11:39.615 --> 00:11:44.708
do hot men shoyn gebrakht fun dortn, fun GOMEL', avu s'iz geven undzer CHAST'

00:11:44.708 --> 00:11:48.158
iz geshtanen, hot men gebrakht shoyn di,

00:11:48.158 --> 00:11:51.208
di gever undzere, di pushkes,

00:11:51.208 --> 00:11:54.133
un mir hobn zikh do ayngefestikt hinter Zhlobin,

00:11:54.133 --> 00:11:57.649
un mir hobn ongehoybn firn a

00:11:58.262 --> 00:12:00.500
ibershos mit di doytshn.

00:12:00.810 --> 00:12:02.660
mir hobn tseklapt a brik.

00:12:03.173 --> 00:12:05.462
undzer polk hot tseklapt a brik.

00:12:05.839 --> 00:12:08.077
s'iz a groyse zakh dan gevezn.

00:12:08.117 --> 00:12:14.270
mir hobn aroysgeklapt, fun Zhlobin, eyn mol hobn mir aroysgeklapt zayne militer.

00:12:14.715 --> 00:12:20.324
az mir zaynen ahin arayngegangen, iz in Zhlobin ⟨g-⟩... nit nor undzer polk — a sakhn.

00:12:20.324 --> 00:12:23.909
m'hot a- arumgeringlt un tseklapt un aroysgetribn zey...

00:12:23.909 --> 00:12:26.252
iz geshtanen undzere tanken,

00:12:26.629 --> 00:12:31.061
avade a draysik tanken, zaynen geven ale farbrent gevorn, tseklapt.

00:12:31.185 --> 00:12:32.647
azoy hobn zey

00:12:33.391 --> 00:12:37.325
mit a mol ongefaln. keyner hot dos nit gevart oyf deroyf.

00:12:37.325 --> 00:12:41.000
s'iz nit geven keyn bafel az me zol,

00:12:41.614 --> 00:12:46.198
 zayn, ongeshtrengt kegn dem soyne.

00:12:47.638 --> 00:12:52.366
es iz bay undz afile nit geven keyn, keyn sakh SNARYADn oyf shisn.

00:12:52.366 --> 00:12:54.703
a pushke darf hobn SNARYADn.

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:56.182
ir farshteyt?

00:12:56.182 --> 00:13:00.727
ot shteyt di pushke... ikh hob aykh demolt bavizn... darf men in ir araynrukn a SNARYAD,

00:13:01.138 --> 00:13:05.666
un der SNARYAD, git men a tsi a shtrikl, git zikh a,

00:13:05.666 --> 00:13:08.788
ot do o, der, VZRYVATEL' a klap,

00:13:08.788 --> 00:13:11.361
flit aveket der SNARYAD tsum soyne.

00:13:11.361 --> 00:13:14.396
iz bay undz keyn SNARYADn oykhet nit geven keyn sakh.

00:13:15.094 --> 00:13:18.159
alts iz geblibn dortn bay dem ⟨soy-⟩ bay dem soyne.

00:13:19.988 --> 00:13:26.483
ot azoy hobn mir geven, mit im, gekemft.

00:13:27.075 --> 00:13:31.001
er hot in undzer polk tseklapt shoyn a sakh mentshn.

00:13:31.497 --> 00:13:35.906
es flegn flien oyf undz keseyder di, di aeroplanen

00:13:35.906 --> 00:13:37.819
un varfn bombes.

00:13:39.512 --> 00:13:43.433
UNK a shod vos ikh ken nit, zogn

00:13:43.433 --> 00:13:47.791
dos oyf english, vos s'heyst bombes. oyf english vi heyst bombes,

00:13:47.791 --> 00:13:51.174
vos flien fun di fliers, di aeroplanen? zey hobn dokh,

00:13:51.174 --> 00:13:53.057
zey flegn flien niderik.

00:13:53.299 --> 00:13:58.766
zey hobn kimat mit di reder, oyb du rekhnst reder oyfn, flier oyf zeyern,

00:13:58.766 --> 00:14:01.156
flegn zey kimat vi fartshepen mentshn.

00:14:01.602 --> 00:14:06.349
es zaynen yidn gelofn fun shtot Babruysk mit kinder.

00:14:07.153 --> 00:14:09.374
zey zaynen gelofn antloyfn.

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:13.745
s'zaynen gegangen m- vayber, meydlekh.

00:14:14.140 --> 00:14:17.492
s'iz geven oyf zey a rakhmones tsu kukn.

00:14:17.785 --> 00:14:21.458
bay eynike ⟨iz⟩ di fis ⟨flegn⟩ shoyn geven ongeshvoln.

00:14:22.459 --> 00:14:27.813
eynike, zey hobn nit gekent shlepn nokh zikh, tsum bayshpil, kinder,

00:14:27.813 --> 00:14:32.290
zaynen kinderlekh eynike aleyn oykhet gevalgert zikh abi avu.

00:14:34.913 --> 00:14:39.774
un do flien zey onet un in mitn drinen tse- tseklapn zey...

00:14:39.774 --> 00:14:45.234
ver s'iz dergangen shoyn bizl GOMEL' un arayngekrokhn ergets in a ban oyf avekforn,

00:14:45.342 --> 00:14:49.399
iz biz der ban fort, iz avek, flien on di flier

00:14:49.399 --> 00:14:53.672
un m'hot tseklapt dem ban mit avade a toyznt man.

00:14:53.566 --> 00:14:55.058
un vu hostu geven?

00:14:54.792 --> 00:14:58.718
un ikh bin geven in mayn, in mayn polk, in mayn CHAST'.

00:14:58.977 --> 00:15:02.166
mir zaynen geven, oyfn front.

00:15:02.318 --> 00:15:04.964
mir zaynen geven, tsum bayshpil, ot iz,

00:15:04.964 --> 00:15:08.538
ot iz, mir hobn oysgegrobn OKOPn.

00:15:09.338 --> 00:15:11.689
ikh bin geven in,

00:15:11.689 --> 00:15:16.824
in rey fun di dos o. ikh bin dan geven a KOMANDIR VZVODA nokh lekhat- tsum bayshpil.

00:15:16.847 --> 00:15:21.683
iz oyf der batarey, bin ikh geven oyfn batarey. der KOMANDIR BATAREI iz geven

00:15:21.683 --> 00:15:24.586
oyfn PEREDOVAer, oyf der, oyf der linye,

00:15:24.711 --> 00:15:27.337
avu fun danen o zet men dem soyne,

00:15:27.664 --> 00:15:30.631
un er git undz di komande.

00:15:30.631 --> 00:15:33.913
flegt er gebn mir di komande in telefon,

00:15:33.913 --> 00:15:37.277
fleg ikh gebn di komande di,

00:15:37.789 --> 00:15:43.666
 vos, di, NAVODCHIKes,

00:15:43.965 --> 00:15:46.726
flegn zey, onshteln

00:15:46.851 --> 00:15:50.405
di pushke vi me darf di pushke... bay mir iz geven fir pushkes...

00:15:50.445 --> 00:15:53.172
un me fleg, m'hot geshosn in dem soyne.

00:15:53.247 --> 00:15:55.198
ot azoy flegn mir zikh opklapn.

00:15:55.238 --> 00:16:00.261
mir flegn optretn un opklapn zikh; mir flegn optretn un opklapn zikh

00:16:00.503 --> 00:16:04.294
biz vanen m'iz dergangen bizl shtot GOMEL'.

00:16:04.890 --> 00:16:06.673
⟨in,⟩ lebn shtot GOMEL'

00:16:06.763 --> 00:16:11.279
hot men, ger- ge- azoy, gekumen undz a bafel,

00:16:11.522 --> 00:16:16.291
a bafel, az mir zoln forn in an ander shtot,

00:16:17.293 --> 00:16:22.062
nit avu es gefint zikh der s-, der soyne tret onet:

00:16:22.339 --> 00:16:25.438
in, dos ruft zikh in rusish "in TYL."

00:16:25.849 --> 00:16:28.357
mir hobn avekgeforn hinter shtot,

00:16:28.684 --> 00:16:31.597
, Moskve, vayter ahin o,

00:16:31.688 --> 00:16:37.133
un m'hot undzer, di gever fun undz tsugenumen,

00:16:37.425 --> 00:16:40.625
un me hot undz gegebn gever a klenere.

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:43.582
ot di gever velkhe bay undz iz geven iz geven,

00:16:43.582 --> 00:16:50.833
 oyf, hundert, TAK,

00:16:50.833 --> 00:16:54.126
TRISTA VOSEMNADTSATYY ARTPOLK,

00:16:54.621 --> 00:17:00.372
VOT, iz bay undz geven hundert I tsvantsik tsvey MILLIMETROVe pushkes hot men undz gegebn,

00:17:00.372 --> 00:17:04.099
mit klenere SNARYADn, velkhe kenen shisn in tanken,

00:17:04.099 --> 00:17:08.841
kenen shisn in, der infanterye, di p⟨a⟩khot- pekhote NASTUPAet,

00:17:08.914 --> 00:17:12.367
un me hot undz avekgeshikt hinter shtot SMOLENSK.

00:17:13.150 --> 00:17:15.844
nu, ot dortn hobn mir oykhet gefirt

00:17:16.946 --> 00:17:18.577
undzer shlakht,

00:17:18.819 --> 00:17:21.192
biz vanen me hot undz arumgeringlt.

00:17:21.502 --> 00:17:24.924
m'hot undz arumgeringlt, iz, veyst dokh,

00:17:24.924 --> 00:17:27.116
az me ringlt arum iz tsores,

00:17:27.190 --> 00:17:28.770
iber hoypt far a yidn.

00:17:28.843 --> 00:17:31.532
ikh hob eyn zakh moyre gehat oyfn,

00:17:31.532 --> 00:17:34.533
oyfn, front,

00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:37.683
dos heyst in shlakht, hob ikh

00:17:37.683 --> 00:17:41.057
nor eyn zakh moyre gehat. ikh hob nit moyre gehat az ikh vel

00:17:41.057 --> 00:17:43.983
geharget vern fun a koyl,

00:17:43.983 --> 00:17:47.374
ikh vel geharget vern fun a bombe...

00:17:47.374 --> 00:17:51.309
es flegt flien yeder vayle, di koyln flegn, durkhklapn,

00:17:51.309 --> 00:17:55.724
flien. itster di bombes, mines flegn zey varfn, altsenesding.

00:17:55.724 --> 00:17:59.466
zey hobn dokh zeyer, energish

00:18:00.585 --> 00:18:04.883
ongetrotn oyf undz, gikh,

00:18:05.091 --> 00:18:06.806
mit gute gever.

00:18:06.913 --> 00:18:09.219
mir hobn zikh tsu dertsu nit gegreyt.

00:18:09.850 --> 00:18:13.759
s'iz mernit geven bay undz in lider az mir zaynen shtarker fun alemen.

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:18.399
geven gezogt gevorn in a lid:

00:18:18.473 --> 00:18:24.691
"ESLI VRAG NASTUPIT NA NAS, ZNACHIT,

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:29.286
 BUDEM DRAT'SYA NA EGO ZEMLE." dos heyst, "oyb der soyne

00:18:29.286 --> 00:18:31.252
vet ongr⟨i⟩fn oyf undz,

00:18:31.252 --> 00:18:33.738
veln mir zikh shlogn oyf zayne erd."

00:18:34.268 --> 00:18:37.434
azoy iz geven in di lider, nor es hot zikh bakumen ⟨a-⟩

00:18:37.677 --> 00:18:41.116
f- gor farkert! gor farkert.

00:18:41.507 --> 00:18:42.615
ir farshteyt?

00:18:42.722 --> 00:18:46.358
dos iz alts gevezn bizl

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:50.658
may khoydesh toyznt nayn hundert

00:18:51.531 --> 00:18:53.314
I fertsik tsveytn yor.

00:18:54.248 --> 00:18:56.638
mir hobn opgetrotn azh biz Moskve.

00:18:58.365 --> 00:19:03.024
dernokh dem hot men mir vayter ⟨a-⟩ opgeshikt oyf,

00:19:03.024 --> 00:19:06.763
UNK ⟨in⟩ GENERAL'NOM shtab in Moskve

00:19:06.938 --> 00:19:10.200
un me hot mir op- me hot mir,

00:19:10.200 --> 00:19:12.905
opgeshikt in an ander teyl.

00:19:13.806 --> 00:19:19.841
VOT., tsvey hundert I draysik zekste teyl heyst zi, ⟨artteyl⟩.

00:19:21.298 --> 00:19:24.414
⟨m'hot mir⟩ gegebn shoyn naye soldatn.

00:19:25.146 --> 00:19:30.449
mir hobn zey dortn o a khoydesh tsayt gelernt, gelernt

00:19:30.449 --> 00:19:37.019
vi tsu... m'hot undz gegebn ⟨a,⟩ soldatn iber hoypt shoyn eltere mentshn: shoyn geven draysik yorike,

00:19:37.060 --> 00:19:40.429
s'iz geven shoyn, finf un draysik yorike.

00:19:40.654 --> 00:19:44.158
⟨sh-⟩ dos iz shoyn geven eltere dan.

00:19:44.367 --> 00:19:48.512
mir iz geven, dan tsvantsik eynter yor iz avek.

00:19:49.277 --> 00:19:53.474
eltere UNK un zey zaynen geven draysik, draysik finf,

00:19:53.474 --> 00:20:01.019
⟨iz⟩ zaynen in der elter- ergets in der, in der elter-, in der ershter velt-milkhome

00:20:01.019 --> 00:20:03.288
zaynen zey geven artileristn.

00:20:03.288 --> 00:20:05.102
vos hobn zey gekent do visn?

00:20:05.102 --> 00:20:08.537
nor kh'veys UNK mir hobn zey ale oysgelernt epes,

00:20:08.537 --> 00:20:12.541
un me hot opgeshikt undzer teyl hinter shtot Kharkev.

00:20:13.037 --> 00:20:18.308
mir zaynen gekumen tsu forn ahin in may khoydesh, hinter shtot Kharkev.

00:20:19.095 --> 00:20:21.266
nu, zey hobn dortn o...

00:20:23.044 --> 00:20:27.158
ikh bin geven in artilerye vos ruft zikh,

00:20:27.274 --> 00:20:31.782
 A.R.G.K.: ARTILLERIYA REZERVA GLAVNOGO KOMANDOVANIYA.

00:20:31.782 --> 00:20:33.130
vos heyst dos?

00:20:34.536 --> 00:20:38.874
mir zaynen, ⟨der, m'iz...⟩

00:20:39.109 --> 00:20:46.978
mir hobn nit gehert avelkhe nit iz kleyner, kleyner, teyl dortn, a divizye tsi a korpus;

00:20:46.978 --> 00:20:49.110
mir hobn geven gehert dem front.

00:20:49.555 --> 00:20:53.758
iz oyb ergets iz geven a durkhrays,

00:20:54.145 --> 00:20:56.079
a durkhrays fun dem soyne,

00:20:56.608 --> 00:21:00.541
hot men undz ahin ibergevorfn.

00:21:00.541 --> 00:21:03.616
mir hobn gedarft forn ahin gikh,

00:21:03.915 --> 00:21:05.633
azoy vi gikhe,

00:21:05.633 --> 00:21:09.202
SKORAYA POMOSHCH', ⟨f-⟩ oyf ⟨g- fo-⟩ vos fort un shrayt

00:21:09.202 --> 00:21:13.749
az me fort, helfn... oder a pozhar, es brent...

00:21:13.956 --> 00:21:16.408
⟨veyst ir,⟩ es brent ergets,

00:21:16.408 --> 00:21:19.671
forn di pozharnikes un shrayen, "ha ha ha ha!"

00:21:19.744 --> 00:21:21.572
azoy iz undz geven.

00:21:21.572 --> 00:21:25.899
m⟨UNK⟩ ergets fleg zayn a iberrays, dem front,

00:21:25.899 --> 00:21:28.777
a durkhrays, hot men undz ahin

00:21:28.777 --> 00:21:32.884
ibergevorfn, iberf- mir ⟨f- hobn⟩ gedarft ahin forn.

00:21:33.379 --> 00:21:37.058
mir hobn gehat a traktor un TYAGACHes gikhe.

00:21:37.210 --> 00:21:40.427
zey flegn forn fertsik kilometer a, a sho.

00:21:40.905 --> 00:21:46.383
iz hobn mir gikh, gikh geforn mit undzere pushkes un mir hobn dortn, mir zaynen keseyder geven in shlakht.

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:49.489
keseyder geven in shlakht.

00:21:50.625 --> 00:21:57.127
vos vel ikh tsien vayter? ikh'l geyn, dos, ikh'l reydn itster, a bisl, gikher,

00:21:57.127 --> 00:21:59.883
 iberlozn eynike zakhn,

00:21:59.923 --> 00:22:03.444
vorem anit vet er darfn bay mir shraybn etlekhe teg nokh anand.

00:22:03.771 --> 00:22:06.954
⟨iz⟩ derfar,... a tsveytn mol vestu nit kumen?

00:22:07.433 --> 00:22:10.886
iz oyb a tsveytn mol vestu nit kumen, darf ikh iberlozn a sakh.

00:22:12.428 --> 00:22:16.134
in a gutn frimorgn hot men geharget dem KOMANDIR BATAREI.

00:22:16.444 --> 00:22:20.391
der KOMANDIR BATAREI iz geharget gevorn.

00:22:21.793 --> 00:22:23.761
vi iz er geharget gevorn?

00:22:24.156 --> 00:22:26.293
er iz avekgegangen

00:22:27.210 --> 00:22:31.191
oyf... kedey visn in vos tsu shisn,

00:22:31.497 --> 00:22:33.752
darf men frier zen

00:22:34.416 --> 00:22:36.080
in vos du darfst shisn.

00:22:37.200 --> 00:22:41.808
farshteyst? oyb mit pushkes darf men shisn,

00:22:41.808 --> 00:22:44.433
dos iz nit keyn vintovke,

00:22:44.457 --> 00:22:48.568
vos der soldat geyt un shist, oder mitn nagan.

00:22:48.642 --> 00:22:50.070
dos iz a pushke!

00:22:50.228 --> 00:22:54.122
dos darf vayt shisn. di B- di BATAREYA shteyt zeks

00:22:54.122 --> 00:22:56.954
kilometer fun der PEREDOVAe.

00:22:57.062 --> 00:23:02.058
darf ikh gefinen di T- di TSEL', gefinen in vos tsu shisn, in vemen.

00:23:02.361 --> 00:23:05.999
⟨s'iz⟩ nit in a mentshn; ikh darf shisn

00:23:05.999 --> 00:23:07.603
oder in tanken,

00:23:07.693 --> 00:23:13.483
oder ikh darf shisn in a groyser KREPOST',

00:23:13.483 --> 00:23:16.280
⟨,⟩ shteyt in a ZAKREPLЁNNOM ort,

00:23:16.280 --> 00:23:17.981
darf ikh dos durkhklapn.

00:23:19.101 --> 00:23:24.596
iz an andersh mol flegt oyskumen, oto zitst, geyt di pekhote, vos shist mit vintovkes,

00:23:24.703 --> 00:23:27.374
iz an andersh mol darf men geyn V-

00:23:27.690 --> 00:23:32.649
 VPEREDI EGO, geyn, foroys, geyn foroys

00:23:32.649 --> 00:23:34.293
un durkhn binokl,

00:23:34.293 --> 00:23:37.050
durkhn binokl... ⟨mir hobn gehat a groysn⟩ binokl...

00:23:37.360 --> 00:23:41.474
 s'iz geven a STEREOTRUBA, iz di STEREOTRUBA shteyt in OKOP,

00:23:41.474 --> 00:23:43.918
oder az du geyst aroys, iz mitn binokl

00:23:44.110 --> 00:23:47.566
ligndikerheyt durkhpoyzen ahin o. hot im

00:23:47.805 --> 00:23:49.520
ibergeklapt di fis,

00:23:50.641 --> 00:23:52.136
⟨tse⟩klapt di fis.

00:23:52.699 --> 00:23:56.776
emes er iz nebekh geshtorbn iber a, a por sho tsayt.

00:23:57.289 --> 00:24:01.683
hot men avekgeshtelt far a KOMANDIR BATAREI mir.

00:24:02.773 --> 00:24:06.263
bin ikh shoyn avekgegangen fun dortn avu di pushkes.

00:24:06.263 --> 00:24:08.639
ikh bin shoyn ⟨V-,⟩ VPEREDI BATAREI.

00:24:09.338 --> 00:24:13.941
tsu mir ⟨iz ts-⟩ durkhgefirt ⟨a⟩ SVYAZ'.

00:24:14.704 --> 00:24:19.149
veyst vos iz SVYAZ'...? a telefon, telefon POLEVOY,

00:24:19.193 --> 00:24:20.925
f- a feld-telefon.

00:24:21.825 --> 00:24:26.591
opgefirt aza drot a vayter

00:24:26.770 --> 00:24:28.690
a kilometer zeks.

00:24:28.690 --> 00:24:32.209
a kilometer zeks iz azoy vi fun danen, tsum bayshpil,

00:24:32.209 --> 00:24:34.436
 nu, vi ken men dir zogn?

00:24:34.436 --> 00:24:38.880
 ergets v- dortn in DOWNTOWN ergets vayt.

00:24:39.443 --> 00:24:43.824
iz ot aza, aza vaytenish. iz bay mir geven telefonistn.

00:24:43.948 --> 00:24:48.374
zey hobn opgefirt di, di SVYAZ',

00:24:48.374 --> 00:24:50.001
di SVYAZ' iz dortn geven,

00:24:50.023 --> 00:24:51.716
un ikh fleg kukn

00:24:51.716 --> 00:24:55.074
in STEREOTRUBA, aza hoykhe, un fun dortn

00:24:55.074 --> 00:24:57.924
zitsstu in OKOP un du kukst

00:24:58.528 --> 00:24:59.807
un du zest

00:24:59.807 --> 00:25:04.094
⟨in⟩ TSEL', du derzest di TSEL', oder tanken, oder du zest dos,

00:25:04.094 --> 00:25:09.941
, a DOT, ahin, aher, fleg ikh darfn dos, korektirn dem OGON',

00:25:09.941 --> 00:25:11.915
un ikh fleg gebn a komande,

00:25:11.915 --> 00:25:14.135
dortn shtelt men on di pushkes,

00:25:14.135 --> 00:25:17.389
un ikh gib di komande, "OGON'!" "fayer!"

00:25:18.019 --> 00:25:22.158
un ikh kuk shoyn in, in mayn, troyb

00:25:22.158 --> 00:25:24.690
kuk ikh ⟨a-⟩ vi faln ahin di SNARYADn.

00:25:24.690 --> 00:25:28.133
kurts geredt... vos iz faran vos tsu reydn?

00:25:28.296 --> 00:25:31.108
es iz durkhgegangen etlekhe teg.

00:25:33.088 --> 00:25:36.119
UNK,

00:25:36.750 --> 00:25:39.714
ikh bin shoyn arayngegangen in der koleye,

00:25:39.805 --> 00:25:43.700
hot men shoyn geheysn mir ibervarfn di batarey in andere erter,

00:25:43.700 --> 00:25:46.708
in a ander ort, ibergeforn in a ander ort.

00:25:46.708 --> 00:25:51.763
es iz dergangen bizl tsvantsik tsvey, tsvantsik eynte yuni.

00:25:53.878 --> 00:25:57.377
tsvantsik eynte yuni iz dergangen, hern mir shoyn

00:25:57.377 --> 00:26:00.251
az der soyne hot undz genumen in a zak.

00:26:02.839 --> 00:26:04.554
dos ruft zikh "a zak."

00:26:04.797 --> 00:26:07.710
vos heyst a zak? a zak iz, oto, zest?

00:26:07.918 --> 00:26:11.974
a zekl, a zak, nit farmakht oto do o.

00:26:12.947 --> 00:26:15.674
nu, mir zaynen ale ongeshtrengt:

00:26:16.305 --> 00:26:21.283
oyb in a zak, ken er bald undz in gantsn arumringlen.

00:26:22.060 --> 00:26:23.978
oyb er ringlt undz arum,

00:26:24.523 --> 00:26:26.812
un er hot azoy fil makht,

00:26:26.920 --> 00:26:29.040
er hot azoy fil aeroplanen,

00:26:29.451 --> 00:26:31.318
er hot azoy fil gever,

00:26:32.016 --> 00:26:33.714
iz,...

00:26:35.307 --> 00:26:38.641
hot men a ponem di hoypt

00:26:38.641 --> 00:26:41.713
KOMANDOVANIE, di GLAVNOE KOMANDOVANIE

00:26:42.124 --> 00:26:45.881
ge- gereshet, zey hobn bashtimt

00:26:45.972 --> 00:26:49.708
az me darf fun danen aroyskrikhn, fun dem zak.

00:26:50.173 --> 00:26:54.267
iz men, hot men ongehoybn, heyst dos, di CHAST'n antloyfn.

00:26:55.607 --> 00:26:59.683
m'hot zikh oyfgehoybn fun di akopes

00:26:59.775 --> 00:27:03.616
un m'iz avekgelofn oyf dorem, oyf dorem-VOSTOK.
